## Why This Is Asked
Assesses end-to-end design from data gathering to deployment with multilingual and explainability constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Multilingual encoders with adapters
- Weak supervision labeling
- Edge deployment latency
- Explainability techniques
- Drift monitoring per language

## Code Example
```javascript
